BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Evening of Golden Happiness/ James Swanson Artist Reception
DTSTART:20260828T173000
DTEND:20260828T200000
DTSTAMP:20260828T212739Z
UID:68be339826b8938736c7d6c4dcd952@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a relaxed and festive evening at Golden Dog Farm c
 elebrating the work of award-winning artist James Swanson. Fresh from a we
 ek of painting Dewey\, Uncle Lenny and the Butternut Goldens in this idyll
 ic Green Mountain setting\, James will be on hand to share his work\, talk
  about his process\, and mingle with fellow dog lovers and art enthusiasts
 . Cash bar/Hors d'oeuvres\, a curated selection of dogs.\n\nSources: Vermo
 nt Public
LOCATION:Golden Dog Farm\, 1039 Pratt Rd.
