DTSTAMP:20260828T212739Z
UID:ea0fb8d85dac34669fe84e24232501@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Art\, Food\, Music\, & Fun All FREE in downtown St. J Partners
  Discover St. Johnsbury\, the Town of St. Johnsbury\, and Catamount Film &
  Arts present St. J Final Fridays\, bringing a street fair and nightlife f
 eel to the downtown on the last Friday evening of each summer month. Our A
 ugust event theme 'Small Town\, Big Fun' brings a carnival atmosphere & li
 ttle city vibes to the street. 5pm - 8pm\, Street Fair & Gallery Stroll ~ 
 30+ FREE Activities & Live Music on Railroad Street ~ St. J Art on the Str
 eet Gallery Stroll ~ Sidewalk & In-store Sales and Promos ~ Food Trucks\, 
 Outdoor Dining & Beer Garden ~ Free Meals & Goodies Galore 7pm\, Levitt AM
 P St. Johnsbury Music Series - Jon Hayes & The Company Catamount Arts brin
 gs the LevittAMP St. Johnsbury Music Series to downtown St. Johnsbury. Kal
 amazoo-based Jon Hayes' soulful tones and a storytelling ability will remi
 nd you of John Mayer. He and The Company bring connection\, beauty\, hones
 ty\, and truth to the stage. Get the full event details here: https://www.
 discoverstjohnsbury.com/finalfridays Downtown St. Johnsbury\n\nSources: Ve
 rmont Public
