UID:6ea7f908e5745c0d03fac763c91961@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by the timeless classics he listened to growing up\, 
 DJ JP Black specializes in high-energy sets blending Latin\, pop\, and hip
  hop. Whether performing at club nights\, private parties\, or community e
 vents\, JP knows how to read the crowd and keep the vibe alive! Delighted 
 kids and their caregivers soak up some serious summer fun with a DJ-fueled
  dance party in City Hall Park's interactive\, wheelchair accessible splas
 h fountain. Summer in the City is made possible in part thanks to Underwri
 ters at the Pomerleau Family Foundation\; Supporters Burlington Telecom\, 
 Myti\, Soundtoys\, and Lake Champlain Chocolates\, and Community Partner A
 merican Flatbread Burlington & Mothership Brewery. Media Sponsors: Seven D
 ays and WCAX.⁠\n\nSources: Vermont.com\, Vermont Public
